---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_supplied: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_withdrawn: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: tokens already supplied
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert CannotCancelAfterTokenSupply
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_cancel_simple: capital NOT withdrawn
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_return_capital: capital already withdrawn
    q_return_capital --> q_cancel_with_return: project returns full amount + fees
    q_cancel_simple --> q_set_canceled: no return needed
    q_cancel_with_return --> q_set_canceled: capital returned
    q_set_canceled --> [*]: isCanceled = true, emit SaleCanceled

    note right of q_check_withdrawn
        INV-001: cancellation only before token supply
        INV-002: if capital withdrawn, project must return full amount + fees
        INV-003: enables investor refunds via withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled
    end note
